### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Auth Login (open in browser)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/login

### Select business after OAuth (if multiple — use index from console log)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/select-business/0

### FreshBooks Identity
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/me

###  ─── CHART OF ACCOUNTS ────────────────────────────

### List Chart of Accounts
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/chart-of-accounts

### Create Chart of Account (replace parent_account with real account_uuid from GET above)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/chart-of-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Account",
  "number": "1000-2",
  "type": "asset",
  "sub_type": "Cash & Bank",
  "state": "active",
  "parent_account": "b4f1113b-fac3-44a4-92c2-c5631394c1c0"
}

###  ─── CLIENTS ──────────────────────────────────────

### List Clients
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/clients

### Create Client
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fname": "John",
  "lname": "Doe",
  "email": "john@testcompany.com",
  "organization": "Test Company Ltd",
  "currency_code": "USD",
  "language": "en",
  "bus_phone": "123-456-7890",
  "mob_phone": "098-765-4321",
  "p_street": "123 Main St",
  "p_street2": "Suite 100",
  "p_city": "New York",
  "p_province": "NY",
  "p_code": "10001",
  "p_country": "United States",
  "s_street": "123 Main St",
  "s_city": "New York",
  "s_province": "NY",
  "s_code": "10001",
  "s_country": "United States",
  "vat_name": "VAT",
  "vat_number": "",
  "note": "Test client"
}

###  ─── ITEMS ───────────────────────────────────────

### List Items
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/items

### Create Item
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Web Development Service",
  "description": "Hourly web development",
  "sku": "WEB-001",
  "qty": "1",
  "unit_cost": {
    "amount": "100.00",
    "code": "USD"
  },
  "tax1": 0
}

###  ─── VENDORS ─────────────────────────────────────

### List Vendors
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/vendors

### Create Vendor (required: vendor_name, primary_contact_first_name, primary_contact_last_name, primary_contact_email)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/vendors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor_name": "Test Vendor LLC",
  "primary_contact_first_name": "Jane",
  "primary_contact_last_name": "Smith",
  "primary_contact_email": "jane@testvendor.com",
  "phone": "555-000-1111",
  "street": "456 Vendor St",
  "city": "Chicago",
  "province": "IL",
  "postal_code": "60601",
  "country": "United States",
  "currency_code": "USD",
  "language": "en",
  "website": "https://testvendor.com",
  "note": "Test vendor"
}

###  ─── EXPENSES ────────────────────────────────────

### List Expense Categories (get categoryid from here)
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/expense-categories

### List Expenses
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/expenses

### Export All Expenses to Excel (downloads freshbooks_expenses.xlsx)
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/expenses/export

### Create Expense (replace categoryid and staffid with real values)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": {
    "amount": "50.00",
    "code": "USD"
  },
  "categoryid": 10520791,
  "staffid": 1,
  "date": "2026-05-12",
  "vendor": "Office Depot",
  "notes": "Office supplies",
  "clientid": 0
}

###  ─── INVOICES ────────────────────────────────────

### List Invoices
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/invoices

### Create Invoice (replace customerid with real client id)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerid": 270751,
  "create_date": "2026-05-12",
  "currency_code": "USD",
  "due_offset_days": 30,
  "notes": "Thank you for your business",
  "terms": "Net 30",
  "language": "en",
  "lines": [
    {
      "name": "Web Development",
      "description": "Frontend development work",
      "qty": 2,
      "unit_cost": {
        "amount": "100.00",
        "code": "USD"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###  ─── SERVICES ─────────────────────────────────────

### List Services
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/services

### Create Service
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Web Development"
}

###  ─── INCOME ──────────────────────────────────────

### List Income
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/income

### Create Income
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": { "amount": "500.00", "code": "USD" },
  "source": "other",
  "category_name": "other",
  "date": "2026-05-12",
  "note": "Test income entry",
  "payment_type": "Check"
}

###  ─── CREDIT NOTES ───────────────────────────────

### List Credit Notes
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/credit-notes

### Create Credit Note (replace clientid with real value)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/credit-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientid": 270751,
  "credit_number": "CN-001",
  "currency_code": "USD",
  "create_date": "2026-05-12",
  "credit_type": "goodwill",
  "notes": "Test credit note"
}

###  ─── BILLS ───────────────────────────────────────

### List Bills
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/bills

### Create Bill (replace vendorid and categoryid with real values)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorid": 43983,
  "issue_date": "2026-05-12",
  "due_offset_days": 30,
  "currency_code": "USD",
  "language": "en",
  "lines": [
    {
      "categoryid": 10520791,
      "description": "Office supplies",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_cost": {
        "amount": "100.00",
        "code": "USD"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###  ─── BILL PAYMENTS ────────────────────────────────

### Create Bill Payment (replace billid with real bill id)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/bill-payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billid": 11591,
  "amount": { "amount": "100.00", "code": "USD" },
  "paid_date": "2026-05-12",
  "payment_type": "Check",
  "note": "Test bill payment"
}

###  ─── JOURNAL ENTRIES ──────────────────────────────

### List Journal Entries
GET http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/journal-entries

### Create Journal Entry (debit and credit amounts must balance)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEnteredDate": {
    "year": "2026",
    "month": "05",
    "day": "12"
  },
  "name": "Test Journal Entry",
  "journalEntryNumber": "JE001",
  "description": "Test manual journal entry",
  "details": [
    {
      "accountId": "b4f1113b-fac3-44a4-92c2-c5631394c1c0",
      "amount": { "amount": "100.00", "code": "USD" },
      "type": "TYPE_DEBIT"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "63d0389a-f7df-4eeb-9c2d-96b82e61d0ee",
      "amount": { "amount": "100.00", "code": "USD" },
      "type": "TYPE_CREDIT"
    }
  ]
}

###  ─── PAYMENTS ────────────────────────────────────

### Create Invoice Payment (replace invoiceid with real value)
POST http://localhost:3000/freshbooks/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceid": 227951,
  "amount": {
    "amount": "200.00",
    "code": "USD"
  },
  "date": "2026-05-12",
  "type": "Check",
  "note": "Payment for invoice"
}

###  ─── PARSER (reads QBD Exports folder → writes Excel Templates) ──────

### Parse ALL (runs every parser in one shot)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/all

### Parse COA (reads QBD Exports/coa.csv → writes Excel Templates/11_chart_of_accounts.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/coa

### Parse Clients (reads QBD Exports/Client csv.csv → writes Excel Templates/01_clients.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/clients

### Parse Vendors (reads QBD Exports/vendor csv.csv → writes Excel Templates/03_vendors.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/vendors

### Parse Items (reads item.xlsx → writes 02_items.csv — Group/Sales Tax types only)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/items

### Parse Services (reads item.xlsx → writes 12_services.csv — Service/Non-inventory/Other Charge types)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/services

### Parse Invoices (reads QBD Exports/Journal csv.csv → writes Excel Templates/05_invoices.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/invoices

### Parse Expenses (reads QBD Exports/Journal csv.csv → writes Excel Templates/04_expenses.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/expenses

### Parse Income (reads all data (2).xlsx Deposit transactions → writes Excel Templates/06_income.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/income

### Parse Bills (reads all data (2).xlsx Bill transactions → writes Excel Templates/08_bills.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/bills

### Parse Credit Notes (reads all data (2).xlsx Credit Memo/Credit Card Refund transactions → writes Excel Templates/07_credit_notes.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/credit-notes

### Parse Journal Entries (reads all data (2).xlsx General Journal transactions → writes Excel Templates/14_journal_entries.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/journal-entries

### Parse Invoice Payments (reads QBD Exports/Invoice Payment.xlsx Sheet1 → writes Excel Templates/10_invoice_payments.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/invoice-payments

### Parse Bill Payments (reads QBD Exports/Bills Payment.xlsx Sheet1 → writes Excel Templates/09_bill_payments.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/parse/bill-payments

###  ─── MIGRATION (reads Excel Templates folder) ──────

### Migrate ALL (pushes all entities to FreshBooks in dependency order)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/all

### Migrate Chart of Accounts only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/chart-of-accounts

### Migrate Clients only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/clients

### Migrate Items only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/items

### Delete ALL Items from FreshBooks (use before re-migrating)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/migrate/items

### Migrate Vendors only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/vendors

### Migrate Expenses only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/expenses

### Migrate Invoices only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/invoices

### Migrate Income only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/income

### Migrate Credit Notes only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/credit-notes

### Migrate Bills only
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/bills

### Migrate Bill Payments only (billid required in CSV)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/bill-payments

### Migrate Invoice Payments only (invoiceid required in CSV)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/invoice-payments

### Migrate Services only (reads 12_services.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/services

### Migrate Expense Categories only (reads 13_expense_categories.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/expense-categories

### Migrate Journal Entries only (reads 14_journal_entries.csv)
POST http://localhost:3000/migrate/journal-entries


